Subject: [PATCH] Chat: one Chapter card and a Review sheet instead of the
 fanned deck

Figma Changes (16906:4947) item 1, every design version. The proposal
is one card (stacked orbs with a count, the chapter it makes, a one-line
summary, Review changes / Apply changes (N)); Review opens a sheet with
the proposed changes ticked and experiments to add. Behind
RELEASES.chapterCard: on for staging, off for production until shipped,
so the /guide documents can keep moving to production on their own.

